  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "Real-time audio path",
      "items": [
        "VAD runs in the backend process: RMS threshold 300; 800 ms of silence ends the turn (EOT)",
        "Buffered audio is capped at 10 s per turn; active sessions idle out after 30 s",
        "TTS streams over SSE; the browser schedules 24 kHz playback on one timeline for gapless audio"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "violet",
      "title": "Wake word and voiceprint",
      "items": [
        "Idle audio is checked by SANM KWS for \"小云小云\" (xiǎo yún xiǎo yún); a hit starts an active session",
        "Saying the wake word while it talks barge-ins: the current turn is cancelled and playback stops",
        "The voiceprint is derived per turn — from the wake utterance or the first long sentence — and released on idle; never persisted",
        "Cosine similarity threshold 0.5; below that is treated as someone else talking and ignored"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "Two-tier memory",
      "items": [
        "Short-term: messages table — the most recent 20 entries go into the LLM context",
        "Long-term: profile.facts injected into the system prompt, summarised incrementally via a last_message_id watermark",
        "Summarisation runs at session end (idle timeout or disconnect); currently one global stream with no user identity"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "Deployment facts",
      "items": [
        "docker-compose holds only the ASR container and the database; the backend runs on the host",
        "One ASR container, three processes: funasr-server :8000 / voiceprint :8001 / KWS :8002",
        "The frontend is served by the backend — no separate frontend service"
      ]
    }
  ]
